{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO AVANTE! ATLANTIS</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/58de70496f9ed931057cdbe15710099d.poster.avif?t=1773051304\" width=1170 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/58de70496f9ed931057cdbe15710099d.webm?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/58de70496f9ed931057cdbe15710099d.mp4?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tactical turn-based adventure with the charm of a living board game. Command vibrant armies, uncover ancient truths, and fight for control of a world where every tile matters and every move carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY BEGINS \u2192 Atlantis Has Risen</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/ef5281d1bf40126e75ccfb726465967b.poster.avif?t=1773051304\" width=1170 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/ef5281d1bf40126e75ccfb726465967b.webm?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/ef5281d1bf40126e75ccfb726465967b.mp4?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >March across the reawakened island as the world's factions collide in the first <strong>Virtual War</strong>, each determined to claim Atlantis. Face rival commanders, outmaneuver their armies, and <strong>uncover the hidden forces</strong> that kept the island shrouded in <strong>mystery</strong> for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WAYS TO PLAY \u2192 Choose Your Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/dd88316d1b84bb280c52f152ed91bde3.poster.avif?t=1773051304\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/dd88316d1b84bb280c52f152ed91bde3.webm?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/dd88316d1b84bb280c52f152ed91bde3.mp4?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the <strong>Computer</strong>, battle a <strong>friend locally</strong>, or <strong>play online</strong>: from <strong>quick fights</strong> you can slip into your day to <strong>longer encounters</strong> that unfold like a true battlefield campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE DICE SYSTEM \u2192 Strategy With a Twist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/529a7e803b5397e4dac359b383e0ac2e.poster.avif?t=1773051304\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/529a7e803b5397e4dac359b383e0ac2e.webm?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/529a7e803b5397e4dac359b383e0ac2e.mp4?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>custom D20</strong> and <strong>elemental D6, D4, and D8</strong> add small but meaningful swings to combat. Each roll nudges your unit's power, keeping battles dynamic without overshadowing strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STRATEGISTS\u2192 Characters With Attitude</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/a53ac989ce3ba1ecb6d283a57a2e91fc.poster.avif?t=1773051304\" width=1170 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/a53ac989ce3ba1ecb6d283a57a2e91fc.webm?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/a53ac989ce3ba1ecb6d283a57a2e91fc.mp4?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle with a colorful roster of <strong>eight</strong> commanders: from an <strong>Angry General</strong> to a <strong>Genius Chess Kid</strong>, a <strong>Goth Detective</strong> to a <strong>Retired Kingpin</strong>. Every leader brings a signature ability and a personality you won\u2019t forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ARSENAL\u00a0\u2192 20 Unique Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/ab1e65899b7a00436fb541e7facbdc12.poster.avif?t=1773051304\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/ab1e65899b7a00436fb541e7facbdc12.webm?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/ab1e65899b7a00436fb541e7facbdc12.mp4?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy\u00a0<strong>20 Units</strong>, each with its own abilities and tactical strategies. From\u00a0<strong>Standard troops </strong>to\u00a0<strong>heavy machines</strong>, even quirky units like <strong>Magnets</strong>,\u00a0<strong>Drills and Lasers,</strong>\u00a0every unit has a role to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORLD \u2192 8 Biomes, Endless Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/c21bac453f7cd17106d5614a24e1e46a.poster.avif?t=1773051304\" width=1170 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/c21bac453f7cd17106d5614a24e1e46a.webm?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/c21bac453f7cd17106d5614a24e1e46a.mp4?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across <strong>eight distinct biomes</strong>, freely mixed to form unique maps. Each biome offers its own tiles and special tiles: some protect, some heal, some break under your feet! Positioning matters as much as the units you deploy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE EDITOR \u2192 Build Your Battleground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/bb7c284e8d46c473cb770dad42d01fa9.poster.avif?t=1773051304\" width=1170 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/bb7c284e8d46c473cb770dad42d01fa9.webm?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/bb7c284e8d46c473cb770dad42d01fa9.mp4?t=1773051304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own arenas using the full map creator. Mix biomes, shape terrain, craft clever layouts, and share your creations with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you seize the moment and claim Atlantis?<br>The adventure awaits.<br> <strong><i>Avante to glory!</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3172160?t=1773051304","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/56af6088b000d1c880e56705e28eec68352c8336/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773051304","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/3e83115c542ff28b29684261eb8a01c0f57f6823/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773051304","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/3e83115c542ff28b29684261eb8a01c0f57f6823/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773051304","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"descriptio